OL,3,AImmigration agents search Congresswoman
OL,4,AIlhan Omar's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS immigration agents searched the home
OL,7,Fof Minnesota Representative Ilhan Omar
OL,8,Fon Monday morning as part of a criminal
OL,9,Finvestigation.
OL,11,FHomeland Security Investigations (HSI)
OL,12,Fagents "executed a judicially
OL,13,Fauthorised search warrant" for the home
OL,14,Fin the Washington, DC area, a US
OL,15,Fjustice department spokesperson told
OL,16,Fthe BBC.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
